OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 03 SEP
OL,4,CCHANNELS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1984FThe technicians' strike at
OL,7,FThames Television is resolved. But the
OL,8,Fmorning schedule is blacked out. TV-am
OL,9,Ftransmissions are unaffected.
OL,10,
OL,11,FThe strike ended at 1pm after the union
OL,12,Fagreed to rostering according to need,
OL,13,Fwhile the management dropped plans for
OL,14,Fending six-day working fortnights.
OL,15,FBryan Cowgill said:
OL,16,
OL,17,F"The need for sensible change in the
OL,18,Fway we conduct our operations has been
OL,19,Fat the heart of this dispute. The
OL,20,Foutcome of a damaging and costly
OL,21,Fdispute has resulted in substantial
OL,22,Fprogress towards a more realistic and
OL,23,Sppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
