OL,4,CCHANNELS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG2020FSky Sports NFL begins
OL,7,Fbroadcasting. Sky and the NFL agreed a
OL,8,Fnew five-year deal to broadcast the
OL,9,FNFL. This was the first time the league
OL,10,Fpartnered with an international
OL,11,Fbroadcaster to launch a channel
OL,12,Fdedicated to the sport.
